providers: claude (from canon.yaml skills.providers)
status: healthy
stray: ./.agents/skills/canon — codex is not a selected provider (from canon.yaml skills.providers), so canon no longer updates it; remove it with `rm -r ./.agents/skills/canon`, or select it with `canon skills install --providers=claude,codex`
owned-paths: canon writes these; exclude them from formatters and linters:
  .claude/skills/canon/**
  .canon/REPORT.md
  .canon/artifact-store.lock
  .canon/artifacts/**
  .canon/audit/**
  .canon/dashboard-snapshot/**
  .canon/hot.db*
  .canon/ingest/**
  .canon/learn/**
  .canon/ledger/**
  .canon/plugins/**
  .canon/policy.approval.json
  .canon/policy.yaml
  .canon/r2/**
  .canon/scenario-index.lock
  .canon/scripts/canon-gate-pre-commit.sh
  .canon/skills/**
  .canon/specs/**
  .canon/strategies/**
  .canon/vocab/**
